 eceives EUR 1\,100 per month and a rent-free furnished studio apartment in
  central Weimar\; the programme closes with a group exhibition the followi
 ng year.\n\nOrganisation: ACC Galerie Weimar and the City of Weimar\nLocat
 ion: Weimar\, Germany. Open worldwide\, all ages\; enrolled students exclu
 ded\; working language English or German.\nAward: EUR 1\,100 per month sti
 pend for four months\, plus a rent-free furnished studio apartment and a g
 roup exhibition the following year. No application fee.\nDuration: 4 month
 s\n\nMore: https://acc-weimar.de/atelierprogramm/?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
