 rials allowance\, and free on-site housing with utilities\, wi-fi and laun
 dry included.\nDuration: One month: June\, July\, August or September 2027
  (four residencies awarded).\n\nMore: https://www.theadkx.org/adirondack-e
 xperience-artist-in-residence/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
