 -Institut\nLocation: Legal entities registered in a Creative Europe countr
 y (including overseas countries and territories and outermost regions)\, h
 osting 1 to 5 residents from other Creative Europe countries.\nAward: Host
 s: EUR 50 per day per resident plus accessibility support of EUR 375\, 675
  or 1\,200 depending on residency length. Residents: EUR 30 per day\, trav
 el allowance of EUR 400 (under 5\,000 km) or EUR 800\, and top-ups for gre
 en travel (EUR 400)\, OCT/outermost regions (EUR 175)\, family (EUR 200 pe
 r child) and visa (EUR 120). No application fee.\nDuration: Residencies fr
 om 12 April 2027 onward\; hosts choose residents and submit residency info
  between 9 March and 31 July 2027.\n\nMore: https://culture.ec.europa.eu/c
 ulture-moves-europe/call-for-residency-hosts?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
